    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέλπομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιέλπομαι</span></b> , poet. Verb, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have hopes of, hope,</i> c.
				inf.
			fut., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ δὴ . . ἐμοὺς ἐπιέλπεο μύθους
					εἰδήσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.545
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιελπόμενος τό γε θυμῷ, νευρὴν
				ἐντανύειν</span> (fut.
			inf., v. l. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σειν</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.126
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἐπελπομένα . . ἐκτολυπεύσειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1031
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): generally, <i>expect,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Telest.
				1.1
			</span></i>.</div>
